# PHANTOM SHELL — COMPLETE GOOGLE AI STUDIO APP-BUILDING PROMPT

## Project Identity

You are an elite creative developer, senior full-stack engineer, terminal emulator designer, AI application architect, interactive fiction writer, and UI/UX specialist.

Build a complete, polished, interactive web application named **PHANTOM SHELL**.

**Tagline:** “Something is listening between the lines.”

**Theme:** Ghost in the Machine — Hacktoberfest 2026 Open-Source AI Challenge, Week 4.

**Core concept:** PHANTOM SHELL is a haunted, fictional computer terminal inhabited by an enigmatic digital ghost. Users type commands into a simulated command-line environment. The terminal responds with realistic-looking simulated output, eerie commentary, cryptic clues, hidden files, puzzles, missions, and an unfolding supernatural digital mystery.

The ghost should feel intelligent, mysterious, occasionally humorous, and increasingly aware of the user's progress.

This is an interactive fictional experience, not a normal chatbot with a terminal skin.

Build the actual working application in the current Google AI Studio project. Do not stop at a design description, wireframe, landing page, or code snippets.

